'''Spider''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by completing all the Bingo Challenges during the [[Halloween Event 2015|2015 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
This knife includes a dull blade with a spider's legs. The blade and handle has a black web-looking texture pattern. There is also a red line straight through the middle, (It may resemble a Black Widow Spider, since they have a red hourglass shape on their back) and the blade also has a spear shape.

== Trivia ==
* Spider was the only [[Godly Weapons|godly]] obtainable from the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Halloween_Event_2015#Bingo_Challenge Bingo Challenge].
* It was one of the first godlys to be released in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/302502491/Spider-Slasher Spider Slasher]. 

